erson County","/arc-plc/texas/henderson-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, September to October has come in under 90% of normal in 39 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids. In 2025 that same pair ran 54% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 41% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 14536 had its driest year in 1963 at 56%.</p>"}
